			"Message": "feat(Common): Add EvaluatableExpression and InlineValues provider types\n\nAdd two new LSP language feature provider types to the ProviderType enum:\n- EvaluatableExpression (value 26)\n- InlineValues (value 27)\n\nThese provider types extend the editor's LSP language feature coverage to support evaluatable expressions and inline values from language servers.",
